243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 97 0 R
/T (As your Dais, we are beyond excited to welcome you to what promises to be an intense, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding conference.The Security Council stands as the apex body for international peace and security. Unlike any other committee, the decisions you make here carry binding weight, demanding not only a deep grasp of foreign policy, but also high-level diplomacy, quick critical thinking, and a willingness to compromise under pressure.)
/E (As your Dais, we are beyond excited to welcome you to what promises to be an intense, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding conference.The Security Council stands as the apex body for international peace and security. Unlike any other committee, the decisions you make here carry binding weight, demanding not only a deep grasp of foreign policy, but also high-level diplomacy, quick critical thinking, and a willingness to compromise under pressure.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 97 0 R
/T (2026!Every MUN conference presents a unique opportunity to step into the shoes of global decision-makers, address critical threats to international peace and security, and harness the power of diplomacy. Our theme, "Radical Resilience: Engineering Stability in an Age of Volatility," calls on us to recognize that uncertainty is a defining feature of today's geopolitical landscape.As members of the Security Council, you will be challenged to balance national strategic interests with collective global responsibility, negotiate with purpose, and formulate practical, high-impact resolutions.)
/E (2026!Every MUN conference presents a unique opportunity to step into the shoes of global decision-makers, address critical threats to international peace and security, and harness the power of diplomacy. Our theme, "Radical Resilience: Engineering Stability in an Age of Volatility," calls on us to recognize that uncertainty is a defining feature of today's geopolitical landscape.As members of the Security Council, you will be challenged to balance national strategic interests with collective global responsibility, negotiate with purpose, and formulate practical, high-impact resolutions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
