/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 101 0 R
/T (Beyond direct conflicts, regional tensions have expanded into areas such as maritime security, cyber operations, and cross-border attacks. The rivalry between Iran and Israel remains a major factor influencing regional security, with allied armed groups and regional partners playing significant roles in ongoing tensions. These developments have increased concerns that a localized confrontation could develop into a wider regional conflict.)
/E (Beyond direct conflicts, regional tensions have expanded into areas such as maritime security, cyber operations, and cross-border attacks. The rivalry between Iran and Israel remains a major factor influencing regional security, with allied armed groups and regional partners playing significant roles in ongoing tensions. These developments have increased concerns that a localized confrontation could develop into a wider regional conflict.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
