/P 101 0 R
/T (Maritime security has also become a key international concern. Strategic waterways such as the Strait of Hormuz and the Red Sea are essential for global trade and energy transportation. Any disruption to these routes could have consequences for international markets and economic stability.)
/E (Maritime security has also become a key international concern. Strategic waterways such as the Strait of Hormuz and the Red Sea are essential for global trade and energy transportation. Any disruption to these routes could have consequences for international markets and economic stability.)
/Pg 16 0 R
