410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (In April 2023, tensions between the SAF, led by General Abdel Fattah al-Burhan, and the RSF, led by Mohamed Hamdan Dagalo \(Hemedti\), escalated into open conflict. Fighting began in Khartoum before spreading to other parts of Sudan, including Darfur, Kordofan, and other regions.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
