412 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (As the conflict continued, Sudan experienced increasing displacement, food insecurity, and damage to essential services. Humanitarian organizations have reported severe challenges in delivering aid due to insecurity, restricted access, and ongoing fighting. The prolonged conflict has made Sudan one of the largest displacement crises in the world and increased concerns about regional instability.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [11]
>>
