/Title (Diplomatic engagement remains essential in preventing further escalation. The committee should consider how the United Nations, regional organizations, and neutral states can support negotiations, establish ceasefires, and create frameworks for long-term regional stability.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1322 0 R
/Next 1146 0 R
>>
