1237 0 obj
<<
/Title (The conflict in Sudan has escalated into one of the most severe, complex, and catastrophic humanitarian and security crises in modern history. What began in April 2023 as a brutal power struggle between the Sudanese Armed Forces \(SAF\) and the paramilitary Rapid Support Forces \(RSF\) has rapidly spiraled into a devastating civil war. The fighting has destroyed critical national infrastructure, brought basic public services and healthcare to total collapse, and fueled widespread violence against civilians including targeted ethnic attacks and systemic human rights abuses. This institutional breakdown has triggered the world's largest displacement crisis and pushed millions of people toward severe malnutrition and famine conditions across the country.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1147 0 R
/Next 1324 0 R
>>
endobj
1238 0 obj
<<
