/Title (Serious concerns have also been raised regarding violations of international humanitarian law. Reports of attacks against civilians, conflict-related sexual violence, forced displacement, and destruction of civilian infrastructure have highlighted the urgent need for stronger protection measures and accountability mechanisms.)
