/Title (As your Dais, we are beyond excited to welcome you to what promises to be an intense, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding conference.The Security Council stands as the apex body for international peace and security. Unlike any other committee, the decisions you make here carry binding weight, demanding not only a deep grasp of foreign policy, but also high-level diplomacy, quick critical thinking, and a willingness to compromise under pressure.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1145 0 R
/Prev 1231 0 R
/Next 1367 0 R
>>
endobj
1318 0 obj
<<
