>>
endobj
1319 0 obj
<<
/Title (Emily Akweley Atitiati  CHAIR, UNSC)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1233 0 R
/Next 1369 0 R
>>
endobj
1320 0 obj
<<
/Title (I look forward to meeting each of you and witnessing the insightful discussions and innovative ideas you will bring to committee. I wish you the very best in your preparation, and I hope your experience at DPS I MUN 2026 is both enjoyable and inspiring.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1233 0 R
/Prev 1370 0 R
/First 1371 0 R
/Last 1371 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
1321 0 obj
<<
/Title (1.3  [General Overview])
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
