/Next 1374 0 R
>>
endobj
1322 0 obj
<<
/Title (The security of major maritime routes remains a global concern due to their importance for international trade and energy transportation. Delegates should examine ways to protect commercial shipping, prevent attacks on vessels, and maintain freedom of navigation without further increasing regional tensions.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1375 0 R
/First 1376 0 R
/Last 1376 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 1234 0 R
>>
endobj
1323 0 obj
<<
/Title (Uncrewed Aerial Vehicle \(UAV\) -An aircraft operated without a human pilot onboard, commonly used for surveillance, reconnaissance, and, in some conflicts, military operations. here)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1146 0 R
/Prev 1235 0 R
/Next 1236 0 R
>>
endobj
1324 0 obj
<<
/Title (Beyond Sudan's borders, the conflict poses acute security and socio-economic risks to an already fragile region. The massive outflow of millions of refugees into neighboring nations like Chad, South Sudan, Egypt, and Ethiopia has severely strained local resources, exacerbating regional humanitarian pressures. Furthermore, the conflict's expansion threatens the broader stability of the Horn of Africa, the Red Sea corridor, and the Sahel region. Border porousness has accelerated the illicit trafficking of small arms and light weapons, while competing foreign interests and proxy dynamics threaten to entrench the war and further complicate diplomatic peace building.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1147 0 R
/Prev 1237 0 R
/Next 1377 0 R
>>
endobj
1325 0 obj
<<
/Title (2023: Outbreak of SAF-RSF Conflict)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1147 0 R
/Prev 1378 0 R
/Next 1238 0 R
>>
endobj
1326 0 obj
<<
/Title (The conflict has divided control of Sudan between competing armed actors, with the SAF and RSF maintaining influence over different regions of the country. This fragmentation has made humanitarian operations increasingly difficult and has complicated international efforts to negotiate a lasting ceasefire.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 556 0 R
/Prev 1239 0 R
/Next 1327 0 R
>>
endobj
1327 0 obj
<<
/Title (For the Security Council, the challenge is not only ending immediate violence but also addressing the underlying political, security, and humanitarian factors that continue to drive the conflict.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 556 0 R
/Prev 1326 0 R
/First 1379 0 R
/Last 1379 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 1240 0 R
>>
endobj
1328 0 obj
<<
/Title ([Humanitarian Corridor] -A designated route or arrangement that allows the safe movement of humanitarian aid and civilians during periods of conflict.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 558 0 R
/Prev 1241 0 R
/Next 1380 0 R
>>
