/Title (2026!Every MUN conference presents a unique opportunity to step into the shoes of global decision-makers, address critical threats to international peace and security, and harness the power of diplomacy. Our theme, "Radical Resilience: Engineering Stability in an Age of Volatility," calls on us to recognize that uncertainty is a defining feature of today's geopolitical landscape.As members of the Security Council, you will be challenged to balance national strategic interests with collective global responsibility, negotiate with purpose, and formulate practical, high-impact resolutions.)
