/Title (Despite diplomatic initiatives and temporary ceasefire efforts, many underlying political disputes remain unresolved. The Security Council must therefore consider both immediate measures to reduce violence and long-term strategies that address the root causes of instability. Delegates should focus on preventing further escalation while promoting dialogue, civilian protection, and respect for international law.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1389 0 R
/Next 1322 0 R
>>
endobj
