1377 0 obj
<<
/Title (For the international community, particularly the United Nations Security Council and regional bodies, addressing the situation requires a unified and urgent multi-pronged approach. The immediate priority must focus on securing a verifiable, lasting ceasefire, protecting civilians, and establishing unhindered cross-border and cross-line humanitarian corridors to deliver life-saving aid. Concurrently, international efforts must enforce sanctions, ensure accountability for war crimes, and support a comprehensive diplomatic pathway. Ultimate stability will depend on transitioning power back to inclusive, civilian-led governance rather than accommodating the military interests of the warring factions.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1147 0 R
/Prev 1324 0 R
/Next 1390 0 R
>>
