/Title (The situation in Gaza, Lebanon, and the wider region continues to raise serious humanitarian and security concerns. Continued hostilities have resulted in civilian casualties, displacement, and significant damage to essential infrastructure. The international community has repeatedly called for the protection of civilians, increased humanitarian access, and adherence to international humanitarian law.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1374 0 R
/Next 1399 0 R
>>
