1398 0 obj
<<
/Title (Following the end of the Cold War, the region experienced further instability. Events such as the Gulf War, the 2003 invasion of Iraq, the rise of extremist organizations such as ISIS, and the Arab Spring uprisings contributed to political uncertainty and weakened state institutions in several countries. These developments created conditions where armed groups gained influence and conflicts became increasingly difficult to contain.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1321 0 R
/Prev 1404 0 R
/Next 1387 0 R
>>
endobj
1399 0 obj
<<
/Title (Beyond direct conflicts, regional tensions have expanded into areas such as maritime security, cyber operations, and cross-border attacks. The rivalry between Iran and Israel remains a major factor influencing regional security, with allied armed groups and regional partners playing significant roles in ongoing tensions. These developments have increased concerns that a localized confrontation could develop into a wider regional conflict.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1388 0 R
/Next 1389 0 R
>>
endobj
1400 0 obj
<<
/Title (2003: Darfur Conflict and the Rise of Armed Groups)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1147 0 R
/Prev 1390 0 R
/Next 1391 0 R
>>
endobj
1401 0 obj
<<
/Title (I look forward to witnessing your passion, creativity, and dedication throughout our sessions. I hope this conference pushes you to grow as a speaker, negotiator, and global citizen.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1233 0 R
/Prev 1395 0 R
/Next 1405 0 R
>>
endobj
1402 0 obj
<<
/Title (I look forward to meeting each of you and witnessing the insightful discussions and innovative ideas you will bring to committee. I wish you the very best in your preparation, and I hope your experience at DPS I MUN 2026 is both enjoyable and inspiring.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1233 0 R
/Prev 1406 0 R
/First 1407 0 R
/Last 1407 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 1396 0 R
>>
endobj
1403 0 obj
<<
/Title (The establishment of Israel in 1948 and the first Arab-Israeli War marked a major turning point in regional history. The conflict resulted in significant displacement and created lasting political disagreements that continue to influence relations between Israel, Palestine, and neighbouring states. Subsequent conflicts, including the Six-Day War in 1967 and the Yom Kippur War in 1973, further intensified regional tensions and shaped modern security concerns.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1321 0 R
/Prev 1397 0 R
/Next 1404 0 R
>>
endobj
1404 0 obj
<<
/Title (During the Cold War, the Middle East became an area of competition between global powers. The United States and the Soviet Union supported different governments and political movements, increasing the international dimension of regional conflicts. Rivalries between major powers often influenced local disputes, making peaceful resolution more difficult.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1321 0 R
/Prev 1403 0 R
/Next 1398 0 R
>>
endobj
