1406 0 obj
<<
/Title (Our theme, "Radical Resilience: Engineering Stability in an Age of Volatility," calls on us to recognize that uncertainty is a defining feature of today's world. As delegates, you will be challenged to balance national interests with global responsibility, negotiate with purpose, and seek solutions that are both practical and impactful.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1233 0 R
/Prev 1410 0 R
/Next 1402 0 R
>>
endobj
1407 0 obj
<<
