1410 0 obj
<<
/Title (It is an honor to serve as your Chair, and I am delighted to welcome you to this committee. Every MUN conference presents an opportunity to step into the shoes of world leaders, tackle complex international challenges, and discover the power of diplomacy. I hope this committee will encourage you to think beyond the obvious, question assumptions, and engage in meaningful debate.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1233 0 R
/Prev 1409 0 R
/Next 1406 0 R
>>
endobj
